"Pixonaut: the customer did not answer the proof of \"%s\" by the deadline, "
"so its design was approved as shown."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : le client n'a pas répondu à l'épreuve de « %s » avant la date "
"limite ; sa création a donc été validée telle quelle."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDeadline.php:275
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer approved the design of \"%s\" just before its "
"deadline."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : le client a validé la création de « %s » juste avant la date "
"limite."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why, as NeedsAttention explains it.
#: src/Approval/ProofDeadline.php:337
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof deadline of \"%1$s\" passed, but the store could not "
"decide it. %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : la date limite de l'épreuve de « %1$s » est dépassée, mais la "
"boutique n'a pas pu trancher. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:96
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer did not approve the design of \"%s\" by the deadline, "
"so it is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : le client n'a pas validé la création de « %s » avant la date "
"limite ; l'article est donc annulé."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:98
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer rejected the proof of \"%s\", so it is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : le client a refusé l'épreuve de « %s » ; l'article est donc "
"annulé."

#. translators: Reason recorded on the refund of an order item, shown to the merchant in the order.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:107
msgid "Design not approved by the deadline"
msgstr "Création non validée avant la date limite"

#. translators: Reason recorded on the refund of an order item, shown to the merchant in the order.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:109
msgid "Design proof rejected by the customer"
msgstr "Épreuve de la création refusée par le client"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:120
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer did not approve the design of \"%s\" by the deadline, "
"so it was rejected and will not be printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : le client n'a pas validé la création de « %s » avant la date "
"limite ; elle a donc été refusée et ne sera pas imprimée. Remboursez ou "
"annulez l'article."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:122
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer rejected the proof of \"%s\", so it will not be "
"printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : le client a refusé l'épreuve de « %s » ; l'article ne sera donc "
"pas imprimé. Remboursez ou annulez l'article."

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to a design the customer never answers. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:66
msgid "Approve the design as shown"
msgstr "Valider la création telle quelle"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to a design the customer never answers. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:68
msgid "Deny the design"
msgstr "Refuser la création"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to an order item whose design is denied. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:85
msgid "Refund and cancel the item"
msgstr "Rembourser et annuler l'article"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to an order item whose design is denied. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:87
msgid "Cancel the item"
msgstr "Annuler l'article"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to an order item whose design is denied. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:89
msgid "Mark the item as needing attention"
msgstr "Marquer l'article comme à traiter"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:91
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof of \"%s\" was not sent. Its design was changed in "
"Pixonaut after it was bought."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : l'épreuve de « %s » n'a pas été envoyée. Sa création a été "
"modifiée dans Pixonaut après l'achat."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:105
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof of \"%s\" was not sent. Its design is no longer waiting "
"for approval in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : l'épreuve de « %s » n'a pas été envoyée. Sa création n'est plus "
"en attente de validation dans Pixonaut."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:131
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof of \"%1$s\" was not sent. Pixonaut refused its proof "
"page: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : l'épreuve de « %1$s » n'a pas été envoyée. Pixonaut a refusé sa "
"page d'épreuve : %2$s."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" is awaiting design approval. The customer was sent a proof "
"to approve."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : « %s » est en attente de validation de la création. Une épreuve à "
"valider a été envoyée au client."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofTimers.php:230
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof deadline of \"%s\" could not be scheduled, so the store "
"will not decide it on its own. The proof stays open for the customer; "
"approve or cancel the item when they do not answer."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut : la date limite de l'épreuve de « %s » n'a pas pu être planifiée ; "
"la boutique ne tranchera donc pas d'elle-même. L'épreuve reste ouverte pour "
"le client ; validez ou annulez l'article s'il ne répond pas."

#. translators: Option in the approval setting, shown to the merchant on the settings page and the product page.
#: src/ApprovalMode.php:58
msgid "Adding to the cart approves the design"
msgstr "L'ajout au panier valide la création"

#. translators: Option in the approval setting, shown to the merchant; the quoted text is the checkbox label the shopper sees.
#: src/ApprovalMode.php:60
msgid "Customer ticks \"I approve the preview\""
msgstr "Le client coche « Je valide l'aperçu »"

#. translators: Option in the approval setting, shown to the merchant: the shopper approves a proof sent by email once the order is paid.
#: src/ApprovalMode.php:62
msgid "Proof by email after payment"
msgstr "Épreuve par e-mail après paiement"

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: Pixonaut's refusal code
#: src/Cart/AddToCart.php:820
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot add \"%1$s\" to the cart: Pixonaut will not route its "
"designs to a printshop (%2$s). Check the printshop of the product's blank in "
"the Pixonaut studio."
msgstr ""
"Les clients ne peuvent pas ajouter « %1$s » au panier : Pixonaut "
"n'acheminera pas ses créations vers un imprimeur (%2$s). Vérifiez "
"l'imprimeur du produit vierge de ce produit dans le studio Pixonaut."

#. translators: 1: link to the Pixonaut studio, 2: link to the troubleshooting guide.
#: src/Cart/CommitFailures.php:167
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot add personalised products to the cart: Pixonaut suspended "
"the workspace, so it saves no designs. Check the workspace's plan and "
"billing in the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Pixonaut studio</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Troubleshooting</a>"
msgstr ""
"Les clients ne peuvent pas ajouter de produits personnalisés au panier : "
"Pixonaut a suspendu l'espace de travail et n'enregistre donc aucune "
"création. Vérifiez l'offre et la facturation de l'espace de travail dans le "
"<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">studio "
"Pixonaut</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Dépannage</a>"

#. translators: 1: link to the Pixonaut studio, 2: link to the troubleshooting guide.
#: src/Cart/CommitFailures.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot add personalised products to the cart: Pixonaut keeps "
"refusing or not answering when the store saves their designs. Check the "
"workspace in the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Pixonaut studio</a>, and the pixonaut-api log under WooCommerce "
"> Status > Logs. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Troubleshooting</a>"
msgstr ""
"Les clients ne peuvent pas ajouter de produits personnalisés au panier : "
"Pixonaut refuse sans cesse ou ne répond pas lorsque la boutique enregistre "
"leurs créations. Vérifiez l'espace de travail dans le <a href=\"%1$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">studio Pixonaut</a>, ainsi que "
"le journal pixonaut-api sous WooCommerce > État > Journaux. <a href=\"%2$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dépannage</a>"

#. translators: Option of the setting for which view of the product a personalised item's picture shows in the cart and orders. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Cart/PictureView.php:44
msgid "The view the customer previewed"
msgstr "La vue de l'aperçu du client"

#. translators: Option of the setting for which view of the product a personalised item's picture shows in the cart and orders. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Cart/PictureView.php:46
msgid "The placement’s first view"
msgstr "La première vue de l'emplacement"

#. translators: 1: a custom product attribute's name; 2: a global product attribute's taxonomy, e.g. pa_size.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:117
#, php-format
msgid "The product has both %1$s and %2$s. Remove one, then move it."
msgstr "Le produit a à la fois %1$s et %2$s. Retirez-en un, puis déplacez-le."

#. translators: 1: how many variations the product has; 2: the most a move can write.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:125
#, php-format
msgid "The product has %1$d variations, and a move can write at most %2$d."
msgstr ""
"Le produit a %1$d variations, et un déplacement peut en écrire %2$d au plus."

#. translators: 1: a product variation's id; 2: the value it holds of a custom product attribute; 3: the attribute's name.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:164
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Variation %1$d holds %2$s, which %3$s does not offer. Correct the variation, "
"then move it."
msgstr ""
"La variation %1$d contient %2$s, que %3$s ne propose pas. Corrigez la "
"variation, puis déplacez le produit."

#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:271
msgid ""
"The product changed meanwhile and no longer has this attribute. Nothing was "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Le produit a changé entre-temps et n'a plus cet attribut. Rien n'a été "
"modifié."

#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:407
msgid "The product's attribute could not be saved. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"L'attribut du produit n'a pas pu être enregistré. Rien n'a été modifié."

#. translators: %d: a product variation's id.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:418
#, php-format
msgid "Variation %d could not be saved. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "La variation %d n'a pas pu être enregistrée. Rien n'a été modifié."

#. translators: 1, 2: two values of a custom product attribute.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:572
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s and %2$s have the same slug, so the move could not tell which a "
"variation holds. Rename one, then move it."
msgstr ""
"%1$s et %2$s ont le même slug, si bien que le déplacement n'a pas pu savoir "
"lequel contient une variation. Renommez-en un, puis déplacez le produit."

#. translators: 1: a global product attribute's taxonomy, e.g. pa_size; 2: values of a custom product attribute, separated by commas.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:594
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s has no term for: %2$s. Create the terms or name them in term_map, then "
"move it."
msgstr ""
"%1$s n'a pas de terme pour : %2$s. Créez les termes ou nommez-les dans "
"term_map, puis déplacez le produit."

#. translators: %s: a global product attribute's taxonomy, e.g. pa_size.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:602
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Two of the product's values would become one term of %s, and customers could "
"no longer tell its variations apart."
msgstr ""
"Deux valeurs du produit deviendraient un seul terme de %s, et les clients ne "
"pourraient plus distinguer ses variations."

#. translators: %d: a product or variation's id.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:633
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d is matched to its blank's variant by the attribute's words, which the "
"move would change, so it would stop selling. Pick its variant with set-"
"product-setup, then move it."
msgstr ""
"%d est associé à la variante de son produit vierge par les mots de "
"l'attribut, que le déplacement modifierait, si bien qu'il cesserait d'être "
"vendu. Choisissez sa variante avec set-product-setup, puis déplacez le "
"produit."

#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:675
msgid ""
"The product's Pixonaut setup changed meanwhile. Nothing was changed; try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"La configuration Pixonaut du produit a changé entre-temps. Rien n'a été "
"modifié ; réessayez."

#. translators: Option of the Canvas shape dropdown: the designer's canvas keeps the template's own proportions at every print size. Admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/CanvasRatio.php:86
msgid "Always the template’s shape"
msgstr "Toujours la forme du modèle"

#. translators: Option of the Canvas shape dropdown: the designer's canvas takes the proportions of the print size the customer chose. Admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/CanvasRatio.php:88
msgid "Always the chosen print size’s shape"
msgstr "Toujours la forme de la taille d'impression choisie"

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:135
msgid "Choose a template."
msgstr "Choisissez un modèle."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:137
msgid "Choose where on the blank the design is printed."
msgstr "Choisissez l'endroit du produit vierge où la création est imprimée."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:139
msgid "The blank no longer exists in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Le produit vierge n'existe plus dans Pixonaut."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:141
msgid ""
"The blank is deleted in Pixonaut. Restore it in the Pixonaut studio, or "
"choose another blank."
msgstr ""
"Le produit vierge est supprimé dans Pixonaut. Restaurez-le dans le studio "
"Pixonaut ou choisissez un autre produit vierge."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:143
msgid ""
"The blank no longer has this placement, or Pixonaut cannot size a print for "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Le produit vierge n'a plus cet emplacement, ou Pixonaut ne peut pas "
"dimensionner d'impression pour celui-ci."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:145
msgid ""
"The template is not published in Pixonaut, or no longer exists. Publish it "
"in the Pixonaut studio, or choose another template."
msgstr ""
"Le modèle n'est pas publié dans Pixonaut ou n'existe plus. Publiez-le dans "
"le studio Pixonaut ou choisissez un autre modèle."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:147
msgid ""
"The template is paused or deleted in Pixonaut. Make it live again, or choose "
"another template."
msgstr ""
"Le modèle est en pause ou supprimé dans Pixonaut. Remettez-le en ligne ou "
"choisissez un autre modèle."

#. translators: %d: most sides a product can have.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:151
#, php-format
msgid "A product has at most %d sides."
msgstr "Un produit a au maximum %d faces."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:155
msgid "Two sides use the same placement. Each placement can be one side only."
msgstr ""
"Deux faces utilisent le même emplacement. Chaque emplacement ne peut "
"correspondre qu'à une seule face."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:157
msgid "Two sides have the same key. Give each side its own."
msgstr "Deux faces ont la même clé. Donnez à chaque face sa propre clé."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:159
msgid ""
"A custom print size needs a width and height in millimetres, both above zero."
msgstr ""
"Une taille d'impression personnalisée nécessite une largeur et une hauteur "
"en millimètres, toutes deux supérieures à zéro."

#. translators: %d: most print sizes one side can offer.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:163
#, php-format
msgid "A side offers at most %d print sizes."
msgstr "Une face propose au maximum %d tailles d'impression."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:167
msgid ""
"Add a print size in millimetres. Without a blank there is no placement to "
"take one from."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez une taille d'impression en millimètres. Sans produit vierge, aucun "
"emplacement ne peut en fournir une."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:169
msgid "The print size is larger than the placement can print."
msgstr "La taille d'impression dépasse ce que l'emplacement peut imprimer."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:171
msgid "The print size does not match the template's aspect ratio."
msgstr "La taille d'impression ne correspond pas au format du modèle."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:173
msgid ""
"The placement is printed across its whole print area: the print size must be "
"that area."
msgstr ""
"L'emplacement d'impression est imprimé sur toute sa zone d'impression : la "
"taille d'impression doit correspondre exactement à cette zone."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:175
msgid ""
"The template cannot be printed at the print area of this variation's blank "
"variant. Choose a template that fits, or stop selling the variation."
msgstr ""
"Le modèle ne peut pas être imprimé dans la zone d'impression de la variante "
"du produit vierge de cette variation. Choisissez un modèle qui convient, ou "
"cessez de vendre la variation."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:177
msgid ""
"The variation's print size has not been checked since the product changed. "
"Update the product again."
msgstr ""
"La taille d'impression de la variation n'a pas été vérifiée depuis la "
"dernière modification du produit. Mettez à jour le produit à nouveau."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:179
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not check the configuration. Check the connection, then "
"update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas pu vérifier la configuration. Vérifiez la connexion, puis "
"mettez à jour le produit à nouveau."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:181
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a standing side. Check the side's "
"template, placement and print size, then update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut a refusé de générer la création d'une face fixe. Vérifiez le "
"modèle, l'emplacement et la taille d'impression de la face, puis mettez à "
"jour le produit à nouveau."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:183
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a standing side: the store may not "
"create and approve designs. Check the connection's permissions in the "
"Pixonaut studio, then update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut a refusé de générer la création d'une face fixe : la boutique n'est "
"pas autorisée à créer et valider des créations. Vérifiez les autorisations "
"de la connexion dans le studio Pixonaut, puis mettez à jour le produit à "
"nouveau."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:185
msgid ""
"The template of a standing side does not fit the placement at any of the "
"blank's sizes, so none of them can be printed. Choose a template that fits."
msgstr ""
"Le modèle d'une face fixe ne convient à l'emplacement dans aucune des "
"tailles du produit vierge ; aucune ne peut donc être imprimée. Choisissez un "
"modèle qui convient."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:187
msgid "Choose a blank, or a printshop that prints without one."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un produit vierge, ou un imprimeur qui imprime sans produit "
"vierge."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:189
msgid ""
"The configuration was saved by a newer version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce. "
"Update the plugin."
msgstr ""
"La configuration a été enregistrée par une version plus récente de Pixonaut "
"for WooCommerce. Mettez à jour l'extension."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:191
msgid "Pixonaut cannot print this configuration."
msgstr "Pixonaut ne peut pas imprimer cette configuration."

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Beside a template in the template search of the admin product page: the template cannot be printed at these sizes of the blank.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:88
msgid "Cannot print at %l"
msgstr "Impression impossible en %l"

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Warning on a side of the admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:104
msgid ""
"This template does not fit the placement at %l: it cannot be printed at "
"those sizes. Choose a template that fits every size, or stop selling those "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Ce modèle ne convient pas à l'emplacement en %l : il ne peut pas être "
"imprimé dans ces tailles. Choisissez un modèle qui convient à toutes les "
"tailles, ou cessez de vendre ces tailles."

#. translators: 1: width, 2: height, both in millimetres.
#: src/Catalogue/PrintSize.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s × %2$s mm"
msgstr "%1$s × %2$s mm"

#. translators: %s: link to the Pixonaut settings.
#: src/Connection/Connection.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Site URL changed: this site is not the one that connected to Pixonaut, so "
"Pixonaut is paused here and nothing is sent for the site it was copied from. "
"Personalised products and orders are paused until you <a href=\"%s\">connect "
"this site</a>. For a staging site, pick Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"L'URL du site a changé : ce site n'est pas celui qui s'est connecté à "
"Pixonaut ; Pixonaut est donc en pause ici et rien n'est envoyé pour le site "
"dont il est la copie. Les produits personnalisés et les commandes sont en "
"pause jusqu'à ce que vous <a href=\"%s\">connectiez ce site</a>. Pour un "
"site de préproduction, choisissez Sandbox."

#. translators: %s: link to the Pixonaut settings.
#: src/Connection/Connection.php:446
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer accepts this store's key: the store was disconnected in "
"Pixonaut, or its key was revoked. Personalised products and orders are "
"paused until you <a href=\"%s\">connect the store again</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'accepte plus la clé de cette boutique : la boutique a été "
"déconnectée dans Pixonaut, ou sa clé a été révoquée. Les produits "
"personnalisés et les commandes sont en pause jusqu'à ce que vous <a "
"href=\"%s\">connectiez à nouveau la boutique</a>."

#. translators: Print file form on the connection card: one flat image per print.
#: src/Connection/PrintFileForm.php:71
msgid "Flat"
msgstr "Aplati"

#. translators: Print file form on the connection card: each printed layer its own PDF layer, with text turned into shapes.
#: src/Connection/PrintFileForm.php:73
msgid "Layers, text as shapes"
msgstr "Calques, texte vectorisé"

#. translators: Print file form on the connection card: each printed layer its own PDF layer, with plain text kept as editable text.
#: src/Connection/PrintFileForm.php:75
msgid "Layers with live text"
msgstr "Calques avec texte modifiable"

#. translators: 1: a number, 2: its unit, px or mm. A live text tolerance on the connection card, e.g. 0.5 mm.
#: src/Connection/PrintFileForm.php:95
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s %2$s"

#. translators: 1: least and 2: most device pixels, 3: least and 4: most millimetres a live text tolerance may be. Shown on the connection card.
#: src/Connection/PrintFileForm.php:118
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s to %2$s px, or %3$s to %4$s mm"
msgstr "%1$s à %2$s px, ou %3$s à %4$s mm"

#. translators: %s: plugin version, e.g. 1.2.0.
#: src/DeprecatedHooks.php:119
#, php-format
msgid "Deprecated in Pixonaut for WooCommerce %s."
msgstr "Obsolète depuis Pixonaut for WooCommerce %s."

#. translators: Option in the designer language setting, shown to the merchant: use the default language set in the Pixonaut workspace.
#: src/DesignerLanguage.php:110
msgid "Pixonaut workspace default"
msgstr "Langue par défaut de l'espace de travail Pixonaut"

