#: src/Labels.php:458
msgid "Part of your order is on its way. The rest follows as soon as it ships."
msgstr ""
"Une partie de votre commande est en route. Le reste suivra dès son "
"expédition."

#: src/Labels.php:462
msgid ""
"There is new tracking for your order. Follow your parcel with the details "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Un nouveau suivi est disponible pour votre commande. Suivez votre colis "
"grâce aux informations ci-dessous."

#. translators: Accessible name of the tabs that switch between a product's sides, such as front and back, on the product page, read by screen readers.
#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product's sides, such as front and back, each with its template.
#: src/Labels.php:467 templates/admin/product-fields.php:153
msgid "Sides"
msgstr "Faces"

#: src/Labels.php:471
msgid ""
"Your order is paid. Before we print it, please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it. Nothing is printed until you do."
msgstr ""
"Votre commande est payée. Avant l'impression, veuillez vérifier l'épreuve de "
"votre création et la valider. Rien n'est imprimé tant que vous ne l'avez pas "
"fait."

#. translators: Link in the proof email to the shopper, and under the order item on the order received page and in My Account; opens the proof page where the design is approved.
#: src/Labels.php:476
msgid "Review and approve your design"
msgstr "Vérifier et valider votre création"

#: src/Labels.php:480
msgid "Thank you for approving your design. It is now on its way to print."
msgstr ""
"Merci d'avoir validé votre création. Elle part maintenant à l'impression."

#: src/Labels.php:484
msgid ""
"We are still waiting for your approval. Please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it, or tell us what to change. Nothing is printed until "
"you do."
msgstr ""
"Nous attendons toujours votre validation. Veuillez vérifier l'épreuve de "
"votre création et la valider, ou nous indiquer ce qu'il faut modifier. Rien "
"n'est imprimé tant que vous ne l'avez pas fait."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:489
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will print your design as the proof "
"shows it."
msgstr ""
"Sans nouvelles de votre part d'ici le %s, nous imprimerons votre création "
"telle que l'épreuve la montre."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:494
#, php-format
msgid "If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item."
msgstr "Sans nouvelles de votre part d'ici le %s, nous annulerons cet article."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:499
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item and refund it."
msgstr ""
"Sans nouvelles de votre part d'ici le %s, nous annulerons et rembourserons "
"cet article."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:504
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will not print your design and will "
"be in touch about this item."
msgstr ""
"Sans nouvelles de votre part d'ici le %s, nous n'imprimerons pas votre "
"création et reviendrons vers vous au sujet de cet article."

#: src/Labels.php:508
msgid ""
"You did not approve your design by the deadline, so we have cancelled this "
"item. Nothing was printed."
