#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:108
msgid "Default layout"
msgstr "Mise en page par défaut"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:109
msgid ""
"How personalised products show the designer, unless a product overrides it."
msgstr ""
"La façon dont les produits personnalisés affichent l'outil de "
"personnalisation, sauf si un produit la remplace."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:122
msgid "Designer language"
msgstr "Langue de l'outil de personnalisation"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:123
msgid ""
"The language of the designer on the product page, of Pixonaut’s designer the "
"Personalise button opens, and of the proof pages customers approve their "
"designs on. Following the site shows each visitor the site’s language they "
"browse in when Pixonaut has it, and the workspace’s default language when it "
"does not."
msgstr ""
"La langue de l'outil de personnalisation sur la page produit, de l'outil de "
"personnalisation Pixonaut qu'ouvre le bouton Personnaliser et des pages "
"d'épreuve sur lesquelles les clients valident leurs créations. En suivant le "
"site, chaque visiteur voit la langue dans laquelle il consulte le site "
"lorsque Pixonaut la propose, et sinon la langue par défaut de l'espace de "
"travail."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how the product page designer lays out its form. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:136 templates/admin/product-fields.php:215
msgid "Form layout"
msgstr "Mise en page du formulaire"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:137
msgid ""
"How the designer lays out its form, on the product page and in Pixonaut’s "
"designer the Personalise button opens, unless a product overrides it: as the "
"template chose, every step on one page, or one step at a time."
msgstr ""
"La façon dont l'outil de personnalisation présente son formulaire, sur la "
"page produit et dans l'outil de personnalisation Pixonaut qu'ouvre le bouton "
"Personnaliser, sauf si un produit la remplace : selon le choix du modèle, "
"toutes les étapes sur une seule page, ou une étape à la fois."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: each product option, such as Size or Colour, gets a group of its own in the designer's form.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:149
msgid "As its own group"
msgstr "Comme groupe distinct"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:150
msgid ""
"Puts each of a product's options, such as Size or Colour, in a group of its "
"own in the designer's form on the product page, named after the option, in "
"the product's attribute order. Off, the options stay on top of the form, "
"unnumbered. A product whose groups were arranged by hand keeps them."
msgstr ""
"Place chaque option d'un produit, comme la taille ou la couleur, dans un "
"groupe distinct du formulaire de l'outil de personnalisation sur la page "
"produit, nommé d'après l'option, dans l'ordre des attributs du produit. "
"Désactivé, les options restent en haut du formulaire, sans numéro. Un "
"produit dont les groupes ont été organisés à la main les conserve."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: whether the groups of a product's options come before or after the template's groups.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:161
msgid "Place of the option groups"
msgstr "Position des groupes d'options"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:162
msgid ""
"Whether the groups of a product's options come before or after the "
"template's groups."
msgstr ""
"Si les groupes des options d'un produit viennent avant ou après les groupes "
"du modèle."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: whether the designer's form numbers its groups.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing whether the designer's form numbers its groups. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:174 templates/admin/product-fields.php:220
msgid "Group numbers"
msgstr "Numéros des groupes"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:175
msgid ""
"Numbers the groups of the designer's form on the product page: 1 Photo, 2 "
"Text on one page, Step 1 of 2 in steps. Off shows the group names with no "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Numérote les groupes du formulaire de l'outil de personnalisation sur la "
"page produit : 1 Photo, 2 Texte sur une page, Étape 1 sur 2 par étapes. "
"Désactivé, les noms des groupes s'affichent sans numéro."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:186
msgid "Load other colours and views"
msgstr "Charger les autres couleurs et vues"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:187
msgid ""
"Whether the designer loads a product's other colours, views and sides before "
"the customer picks one, so they show at once. Choose In the background or "
"Off for products with many large photos, or for customers mostly on phones."
msgstr ""
"Indique si l'outil de personnalisation charge les autres couleurs, vues et "
"faces d'un produit avant que le client en choisisse une, pour qu'elles "
"s'affichent immédiatement. Choisissez En arrière-plan ou Désactivé pour les "
"produits avec de nombreuses photos volumineuses, ou si vos clients utilisent "
"surtout un téléphone."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:200
msgid "Designer accent colour"
msgstr "Couleur d'accentuation de l'outil de personnalisation"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:201
msgid ""
"The colour the designer on the product page marks the chosen view, colour "
"and option in, and draws its Next button in. None takes the accent colour of "
"the store's brand in Pixonaut, and keeps the designer's own colours when the "
"brand has none."
msgstr ""
"La couleur dans laquelle l'outil de personnalisation de la page produit "
"signale la vue, la couleur et l'option choisies, et dessine son bouton "
"Suivant. Aucune reprend la couleur d'accentuation de la marque de la "
"boutique dans Pixonaut, et conserve les couleurs propres de l'outil de "
"personnalisation si la marque n'en a pas."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:212
msgid "Custom accent colour"
msgstr "Couleur d'accentuation personnalisée"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:213
msgid ""
"The accent colour when Designer accent colour is A custom colour, e.g. "
"#1e73be."
msgstr ""
"La couleur d'accentuation lorsque Couleur d'accentuation de l'outil de "
"personnalisation vaut Une couleur personnalisée, par ex. #1e73be."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:224
msgid "Show the print area's frame"
msgstr "Afficher le cadre de la zone d'impression"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:225
msgid ""
"Draws a thin grey frame on the preview around where the design can go, in "
"the designer on the product page and in Pixonaut's designer the Personalise "
"button opens. Off, the design sits on the product photo as it will be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Dessine un fin cadre gris sur l'aperçu autour de l'endroit où la création "
"peut se placer, dans l'outil de personnalisation de la page produit et dans "
"l'outil de personnalisation Pixonaut qu'ouvre le bouton Personnaliser. "
"Désactivé, la création apparaît sur la photo du produit telle qu'elle sera "
"imprimée."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant. "Hosted page" is Pixonaut's designer page the Personalise button opens.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:235
msgid "Add to cart after approve in hosted page"
msgstr "Ajouter au panier après validation sur la page hébergée"

#. translators: Help text of a setting on the settings page. "Approve and add to cart" and "Approve and go back" are the labels of the button on Pixonaut's designer page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:237
msgid ""
"For the Personalise button layout. Approving adds the product to the cart "
"and opens its cart item's page, and Pixonaut's designer says Approve and add "
"to cart. Off, approving returns to the product page, and it says Approve and "
"go back."
msgstr ""
"Pour la mise en page avec le bouton Personnaliser. La validation ajoute le "
"produit au panier et ouvre la page de cet article du panier, et l'outil de "
"personnalisation de Pixonaut indique Valider et ajouter au panier. "
"Désactivé, la validation ramène à la page du produit, et il indique Valider "
"et revenir."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: how the options of a product option such as a size show in the designer's form.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:248
msgid "Product options in the designer"
msgstr "Options du produit dans l'outil de personnalisation"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:249
msgid ""
"How the designer on the product page shows the options of a variable "
"product, such as its sizes, when it draws them in its form. As the theme "
"shows them (the default) keeps the theme's own field, and any swatches "
"another plugin draws in it. As swatches shows each option as a button like "
"the designer's own choices, an option that cannot be bought with the other "
"choices greyed out."
msgstr ""
"La façon dont l'outil de personnalisation de la page produit affiche les "
"options d'un produit variable, comme ses tailles, lorsqu'il les présente "
"dans son formulaire. Comme le thème les affiche (par défaut) conserve le "
"champ propre au thème, et les boutons qu'une autre extension y dessine. En "
"boutons affiche chaque option sous forme de bouton, comme les choix propres "
"à l'outil de personnalisation. Une option qui ne peut pas être achetée avec "
"les autres choix est grisée."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:261
msgid "Use Pixonaut pictures as product images"
msgstr "Utiliser les images Pixonaut comme images produit"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:262
msgid ""
"Sets each personalised product’s and variation’s image to Pixonaut’s picture "
"of it, its template on the blank, and draws it again when the product "
"changes. A product can show its template’s showcase sets instead, chosen "
"under Product images in its Pixonaut tab. An image you set yourself is kept. "
"Off, each product gets back the image it had before."
msgstr ""
"Définit comme image de chaque produit et variation personnalisés l'image "
"Pixonaut correspondante, son modèle sur le produit vierge, et la régénère "
"lorsque le produit change. Un produit peut plutôt montrer les jeux "
"d'exemples de son modèle, à choisir sous Images produit dans son onglet "
"Pixonaut. Une image que vous définissez vous-même est conservée. Désactivé, "
"chaque produit retrouve l'image qu'il avait auparavant."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the fields are the ones the customer filled in to personalise the item.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:272
msgid "List the design's fields"
msgstr "Lister les champs de la création"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:273
msgid ""
"Lists what the customer filled in under a personalised item in the cart, the "
"checkout, their orders and the order emails, as the designer showed it. Off, "
"the item shows only its name. The order screen in the admin always lists "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Liste ce que le client a rempli sous un article personnalisé dans le panier, "
"à la validation de la commande, dans ses commandes et dans les e-mails de "
"commande, tel que l'outil de personnalisation l'affichait. Désactivé, "
"l'article n'affiche que son nom. L'écran de la commande dans "
"l'administration les liste toujours."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: which view of the product the picture of a personalised item shows.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:284
msgid "Picture shows"
msgstr "L'image montre"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:285
msgid ""
"A personalised item shows the customer’s design on the product in the cart, "
"the checkout, their orders and the order emails. This chooses the view of "
"the product it is drawn in: the one the customer previewed their design in, "
"or the first of the placement’s views the product is shown in."
msgstr ""
"Un article personnalisé montre la création du client sur le produit dans le "
"panier, à la validation de la commande, dans ses commandes et dans les e-"
"mails de commande. Ce réglage choisit la vue du produit dans laquelle elle "
"est montrée : celle dans laquelle le client a vu l'aperçu de sa création, ou "
"la première des vues de l'emplacement dans lesquelles le produit est montré."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:298
msgid "Default approval"
msgstr "Validation par défaut"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:299
msgid ""
"How customers approve their design before it is printed, unless a product "
"overrides it."
msgstr ""
"La façon dont les clients valident leur création avant son impression, sauf "
"si un produit la remplace."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:313
msgid "Proof approval deadline (days)"
msgstr "Date limite de validation de l'épreuve (jours)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:314
msgid ""
"With proof by email, how many days the customer has to approve their proof. "
"The link in the email works a week longer."
msgstr ""
"Avec l'épreuve par e-mail, le nombre de jours dont le client dispose pour "
"valider son épreuve. Le lien de l'e-mail reste valable une semaine de plus."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:326
msgid "When no answer by the deadline"
msgstr "Sans réponse à la date limite"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:327
msgid ""
"With proof by email, what happens to a design the customer neither approved "
"nor rejected by the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Avec l'épreuve par e-mail, ce qu'il advient d'une création que le client n'a "
"ni validée ni refusée avant la date limite."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; what happens to an item whose design the customer rejected.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:340
msgid "On deny"
msgstr "En cas de refus"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:341
msgid ""
"What happens to an item whose design the customer rejected, or which was "
"denied at the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Ce qu'il advient d'un article dont le client a refusé la création, ou qui a "
"été refusé à la date limite."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:355
msgid "First proof reminder after (days)"
msgstr "Premier rappel d'épreuve après (jours)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:356
msgid ""
"Days after the proof email that a customer who has not answered is reminded. "
"Only reminders before the deadline are sent."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de jours après l'e-mail d'épreuve au bout duquel un client qui n'a "
"pas répondu reçoit un rappel. Seuls les rappels antérieurs à la date limite "
"sont envoyés."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:369
msgid "Then remind every (days)"
msgstr "Puis rappeler tous les (jours)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:370
msgid "Days between one proof reminder and the next."
msgstr "Nombre de jours entre un rappel d'épreuve et le suivant."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of reminders.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:383
msgid "Proof reminders at most"
msgstr "Nombre maximal de rappels d'épreuve"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:384
msgid ""
"How many reminders a customer gets at most; 0 sends none. The last one says "
"when the deadline is and what happens then."
msgstr ""
"Le nombre maximal de rappels qu'un client reçoit ; 0 n'en envoie aucun. Le "
"dernier indique la date limite et ce qui se passera ensuite."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the Pixonaut API.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:402
msgid "API base"
msgstr "Base de l'API"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:403
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut API as the browser reaches it, e.g. a local Pixonaut. Empty "
"uses Pixonaut’s own. The store’s key is sent to this address."
msgstr ""
"L'API Pixonaut telle que le navigateur y accède, par ex. un Pixonaut local. "
"Vide, celle de Pixonaut est utilisée. La clé de la boutique est envoyée à "
"cette adresse."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL WordPress uses for the Pixonaut API.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:412
msgid "Server-to-server API base"
msgstr "Base de l'API de serveur à serveur"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:413
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut API as WordPress itself reaches it, when that differs from the "
"browser’s address (WordPress inside Docker, say). Empty uses the API base."
msgstr ""
"L'API Pixonaut telle que WordPress lui-même y accède, lorsque cette adresse "
"diffère de celle du navigateur (WordPress dans Docker, par exemple). Vide, "
"la base de l'API est utilisée."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the Pixonaut studio.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:422
msgid "Studio base"
msgstr "Base du studio"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:423
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut studio, where a connect is approved and the admin’s studio "
"links lead. Empty uses Pixonaut’s own."
msgstr ""
"Le studio Pixonaut, où une connexion est approuvée et vers lequel mènent les "
"liens de l'administration vers le studio. Vide, celui de Pixonaut est "
"utilisé."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the CDN the designer SDK loads from.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:432
msgid "CDN base"
msgstr "Base du CDN"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:433
msgid ""
"Where the pinned designer SDK release loads from, e.g. Pixonaut’s staging "
"CDN. The release’s integrity is still checked. Empty uses Pixonaut’s own."
msgstr ""
"L'endroit d'où se charge la version épinglée du SDK de l'outil de "
"personnalisation, par ex. le CDN de préproduction de Pixonaut. L'intégrité "
"de la version est toujours vérifiée. Vide, celui de Pixonaut est utilisé."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the URL of a designer SDK script.
#. translators: Label of the field for the SDK script's URL, in developer tools.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:442 templates/admin/developer-tools.php:111
msgid "SDK script"
msgstr "Script du SDK"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:443
msgid ""
"Loads the designer SDK from this script, e.g. a local build, instead of the "
"pinned release from the CDN base. Its integrity is not checked. Empty loads "
"the pinned release."
msgstr ""
"Charge le SDK de l'outil de personnalisation depuis ce script, par ex. une "
"version locale, au lieu de la version épinglée de la base du CDN. Son "
"intégrité n'est pas vérifiée. Vide, la version épinglée est chargée."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; turns on debug logging of the designer SDK.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:452
msgid "SDK debug"
msgstr "Débogage du SDK"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:453
msgid ""
"Logs every designer mount and its failures to the browser console. On the "
"storefront, only for logged-in store managers."
msgstr ""
"Consigne chaque montage de l'outil de personnalisation et ses échecs dans la "
"console du navigateur. Sur la boutique, uniquement pour les gestionnaires de "
"boutique connectés."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; turns on a log of requests to Pixonaut.
#. translators: Heading of the table of recent requests to Pixonaut, in developer tools.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:462 templates/admin/developer-tools.php:149
msgid "Request log"
msgstr "Journal des requêtes"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:463
msgid "Records the last 50 requests to Pixonaut, without keys or tokens."
msgstr ""
"Enregistre les 50 dernières requêtes envoyées à Pixonaut, sans clés ni "
"jetons."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:235 src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:248
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:322
msgid "Pixonaut settings"
msgstr "Réglages de Pixonaut"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:293
msgid "You are not allowed to change the Pixonaut settings."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas l'autorisation de modifier les réglages de Pixonaut."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:314
msgid "Your settings have been saved."
msgstr "Vos réglages ont été enregistrés."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:338
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Enregistrer les modifications"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:435
msgid "The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page."
msgstr ""
"Les modifications que vous avez faites seront perdues si vous quittez cette "
"page."

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the settings for the designer on the store's product pages.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:538
msgid "Storefront"
msgstr "Boutique"

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how customers approve their designs, and the proof emails.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:541
msgctxt "settings tab"
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "Validation"

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: which releases of the plugin WordPress offers.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:544
msgctxt "settings tab"
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Mises à jour"

#. translators: Tab of the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the store's connection to its Pixonaut workspace.
#. translators: Heading of the Pixonaut connection card on the settings page.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:547 templates/admin/connection-card.php:109
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Connexion"

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how the designer on product pages looks and behaves.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:563
msgid "Product page designer"
msgstr "Outil de personnalisation de la page produit"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:564
msgid ""
"How the designer looks and behaves on product pages. A product’s Pixonaut "
"tab can change the layouts for that product."
msgstr ""
"L'apparence et le comportement de l'outil de personnalisation sur les pages "
"produit. L'onglet Pixonaut d'un produit peut en modifier les mises en page "
"pour ce produit."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the images of personalised products.
#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product's images drawn by Pixonaut.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:570
#: templates/admin/product-showcase-images.php:58
msgid "Product images"
msgstr "Images produit"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:571
msgid ""
"The image the shop, feeds, emails and search results show for a personalised "
"product."
msgstr ""
"L'image que la boutique, les flux produits, les e-mails et les résultats de "
"recherche affichent pour un produit personnalisé."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how a personalised item shows in the cart, the checkout, orders and emails.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:577
msgid "Cart and orders"
msgstr "Panier et commandes"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:578
msgid ""
"How a personalised item shows in the cart, the checkout, the customer’s "
"orders and the order emails."
msgstr ""
"Comment un article personnalisé s'affiche dans le panier, à la validation de "
"la commande, dans les commandes du client et dans les e-mails de commande."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how customers approve their design before it is printed.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how customers approve their design (proof) before printing. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:584 templates/admin/product-fields.php:225
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "Validation"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:585
msgid ""
"How customers approve their design before it is printed. A product’s "
"Pixonaut tab can choose another way for that product."
msgstr ""
"La façon dont les clients valident leur création avant son impression. "
"L'onglet Pixonaut d'un produit peut choisir un autre mode de validation pour "
"ce produit."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the approval mode where customers approve a proof sent by email.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:591
msgid "Proof by email"
msgstr "Épreuve par e-mail"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:592
msgid ""
"For every product whose approval is Proof by email: how long customers have "
"to answer, the reminders they get, and what happens when they do not approve."
msgstr ""
"Pour chaque produit dont la validation est Épreuve par e-mail : le délai "
"dont disposent les clients pour répondre, les rappels qu'ils reçoivent et ce "
"qui se passe s'ils ne valident pas."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: which releases of this plugin WordPress offers.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:598
msgid "Plugin updates"
msgstr "Mises à jour de l'extension"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:599
msgid ""
"Which releases of this plugin WordPress offers you on the Plugins and "
"Updates screens."
msgstr ""
"Les versions de cette extension que WordPress vous propose sur les écrans "
"Extensions et Mises à jour."

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:620
msgid ""
"Designer accent colour is set to A custom colour: enter the colour, e.g. "
"#1e73be."
msgstr ""
"Le réglage Couleur d'accentuation de l'outil de personnalisation est sur Une "
"couleur personnalisée : saisissez la couleur, par ex. #1e73be."

#. translators: Option in the settings for the designer accent colour. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Accent.php:50
msgid ""
"None: the accent of the store's brand in Pixonaut, else the designer's own "
"colours"
msgstr ""
"Aucune : la couleur d'accentuation de la marque de la boutique dans "
"Pixonaut, sinon les couleurs propres de l'outil de personnalisation"

#. translators: Option in the settings for the designer accent colour. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Accent.php:52
msgid "The theme's primary colour, as its buttons show it"
msgstr "La couleur principale du thème, telle que ses boutons l'affichent"

#. translators: Option in the settings for the designer accent colour; a colour picker follows. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Accent.php:54
msgid "A custom colour"
msgstr "Une couleur personnalisée"

#. translators: Option in the settings for how a product option such as a size shows in the designer's form. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/AttributeOptions.php:45
msgid "As the theme shows them"
msgstr "Comme le thème les affiche"

#. translators: Option in the settings for how a product option such as a size shows in the designer's form: as a row of buttons, one per option, drawn like the designer's own. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/AttributeOptions.php:47
msgid "As swatches, like the designer's own choices"
msgstr "En boutons, comme les choix propres à l'outil de personnalisation"

#. translators: Heading of the designer's group holding the product's options, such as Size or Colour, on the product page.
#: src/Storefront/FormGroupsMount.php:271
msgctxt "designer group of the product options"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Options"

#. translators: Why Pixonaut refused a product, filling in %2$s of a message on the admin product page. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Storefront/KeptDesignerLinks.php:757
msgid ""
"one of the print sizes it offers does not fit its template or its position "
"on the blank. Change the sizes in its Pixonaut tab."
msgstr ""
"l'une des tailles d'impression proposées ne convient pas à son modèle ou à "
"son emplacement sur le produit vierge. Modifiez les tailles dans son onglet "
"Pixonaut."

#. translators: Why Pixonaut refused a product, filling in %2$s of a message on the admin product page. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Storefront/KeptDesignerLinks.php:759
msgid ""
"its blank no longer has a position one of its sides prints on. Pick the "
"positions again in its Pixonaut tab."
msgstr ""
"son produit vierge n'a plus l'emplacement sur lequel l'une de ses faces est "
"imprimée. Choisissez à nouveau les emplacements dans son onglet Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: the error code Pixonaut answered, e.g. `invalid_input`.
#: src/Storefront/KeptDesignerLinks.php:761
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut answered %s."
msgstr "Pixonaut a répondu %s."

#. translators: 1: the product's name, 2: why Pixonaut refused its link.
#: src/Storefront/KeptDesignerLinks.php:765
#, php-format
msgid "Customers cannot open the designer for %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Les clients ne peuvent pas ouvrir l'outil de personnalisation pour %1$s : "
"%2$s"

#. translators: %s: how many of the product are in the cart, as a number. Short for pieces, after the size of a cart item: 1 pc, 2 pcs.
#: src/Storefront/PersonaliseButton.php:516
#, php-format
msgid "%s pc"
msgid_plural "%s pcs"
msgstr[0] "%s pce"
msgstr[1] "%s pces"

#. translators: Option in the settings for preloading product sides in the designer. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Preload.php:48
msgid "Auto: as much as the customer's device and connection allow"
msgstr "Auto : autant que l'appareil et la connexion du client le permettent"

#. translators: Option in the settings for preloading product sides in the designer. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Preload.php:50
msgid "In the background, one at a time"
msgstr "En arrière-plan, un à la fois"

#. translators: Option in the settings for preloading product sides in the designer. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Preload.php:52
msgid "Off: load each one when it is shown"
msgstr "Désactivé : charger chaque élément lorsqu'il s'affiche"

#: src/Storefront/UnavailableProduct.php:94
msgid ""
"Shoppers do not see this product in the shop, search or related products, "
"and cannot buy it: its template is paused or not published in Pixonaut. Make "
"the template live in the Pixonaut studio to sell it again."
msgstr ""
"Les clients ne voient pas ce produit dans la boutique, la recherche ni les "
"produits apparentés, et ne peuvent pas l'acheter : son modèle est en pause "
"ou non publié dans Pixonaut. Remettez le modèle en ligne dans le studio "
"Pixonaut pour le vendre à nouveau."

#. translators: %s: the product's name.
#: src/Storefront/UnavailableReports.php:191
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot personalise “%s”: this version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce "
"is older than the product’s template. Update the Pixonaut for WooCommerce "
"plugin to fix this."
msgstr ""
"Les clients ne peuvent pas personnaliser « %s » : cette version de Pixonaut "
"for WooCommerce est plus ancienne que le modèle du produit. Mettez à jour "
"l'extension Pixonaut for WooCommerce pour corriger cela."

#. translators: 1: the product's name, 2: the host the SDK loads from, e.g. cdn.pixonaut.app.
#: src/Storefront/UnavailableReports.php:201
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut designer could not start for a customer on “%1$s”, so they "
"could not personalise it. Check that the site lets the browser load and run "
"the Pixonaut SDK from %2$s (see Content Security Policy in the Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce developer docs)."
msgstr ""
"L'outil de personnalisation Pixonaut n'a pas pu démarrer pour un client sur "
"« %1$s », qui n'a donc pas pu le personnaliser. Vérifiez que le site permet "
"au navigateur de charger et d'exécuter le SDK Pixonaut depuis %2$s (voir "
"Content Security Policy dans la documentation développeur de Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce)."

#. translators: 1: the product's name, 2: the side's name, e.g. Front.
#: src/Storefront/UnavailableReports.php:239
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer has the placement that the %2$s side of “%1$s” prints on, "
"so customers cannot personalise it. Link the product to a placement again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a plus l'emplacement sur lequel la face %2$s de « %1$s » est "
"imprimée ; les clients ne peuvent donc pas le personnaliser. Associez à "
"nouveau le produit à un emplacement."

#. translators: Title of the update channel setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:77
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Mises à jour"

#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:78
msgid ""
"Beta releases bring new features before they are stable. Use them on a "
"staging site first."
msgstr ""
"Les versions bêta apportent de nouvelles fonctionnalités avant qu'elles ne "
"soient stables. Utilisez-les d'abord sur un site de préproduction."

#. translators: Option in the update channel setting, shown to the merchant: only stable plugin releases.
#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:82
msgid "Stable releases"
msgstr "Versions stables"

#. translators: Option in the update channel setting, shown to the merchant: also pre-release versions of the plugin.
#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:84
msgid "Beta releases"
msgstr "Versions bêta"

#. translators: %s: the new version, e.g. 2.0.0.
#: src/Updates/UpgradeNotice.php:49
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Version %s is a major update and may hold breaking changes. Read its "
"changelog and back up your site before you update."
msgstr ""
"La version %s est une mise à jour majeure et peut comporter des changements "
"incompatibles. Lisez son journal des modifications et sauvegardez votre site "
"avant de mettre à jour."

#. translators: %s: why Pixonaut did not answer, e.g. rate_limited.
#: src/Webhooks/Endpoint.php:203
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut did not send the test request (%s)."
msgstr "Pixonaut n'a pas envoyé la requête de test (%s)."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:46
msgid "The store is connected to Pixonaut."
msgstr "La boutique est connectée à Pixonaut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:47
msgid "The store is disconnected from Pixonaut, and its keys are revoked."
msgstr "La boutique est déconnectée de Pixonaut, et ses clés sont révoquées."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:48
msgid ""
"The store forgot its Pixonaut keys, but Pixonaut could not be reached to "
"revoke them. Disconnect the store on the API Keys page in the Pixonaut "
"studio too."
msgstr ""
"La boutique a oublié ses clés Pixonaut, mais Pixonaut n'a pas pu être joint "
"pour les révoquer. Déconnectez aussi la boutique sur la page API Keys du "
"studio Pixonaut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:49
msgid ""
"This site forgot the connection it was copied with. The site it was copied "
"from stays connected."
msgstr ""
"Ce site a oublié la connexion avec laquelle il a été copié. Le site "
"d'origine reste connecté."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:50
msgid ""
"The store cannot connect while wp-admin is on another address than the site."
msgstr ""
"La boutique ne peut pas se connecter tant que wp-admin se trouve à une autre "
"adresse que le site."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:51
msgid "Pixel can now make changes to your store."
msgstr "Pixel peut désormais apporter des modifications à votre boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:52
msgid "Pixel can no longer make changes to your store."
msgstr "Pixel ne peut plus apporter de modifications à votre boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:53
msgid ""
"Pixel can no longer make changes to your store. Pixonaut could not be told, "
"so the studio may show the switch as on until it next tries."
msgstr ""
"Pixel ne peut plus apporter de modifications à votre boutique. Pixonaut n'a "
"pas pu être prévenu : le studio peut donc afficher l'interrupteur comme "
"activé jusqu'à sa prochaine tentative."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:54
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached or did not accept the store's access, so the "
"switch stays off. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas pu être joint ou n'a pas accepté l'accès de la boutique : "
"l'interrupteur reste désactivé. Réessayez."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:55
msgid ""
"The store could not save the change, so Pixel may still be able to make "
"changes to your store. Check the database, then turn the switch off again."
msgstr ""
"La boutique n'a pas pu enregistrer la modification : il se peut que Pixel "
"puisse encore apporter des modifications à votre boutique. Vérifiez la base "
"de données, puis désactivez à nouveau l'interrupteur."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:56
msgid ""
"The store is connected to Pixonaut, but Pixonaut could not be reached or did "
"not accept the store's access, so Pixel cannot make changes to your store. "
"Turn the switch on below to try again."
msgstr ""
"La boutique est connectée à Pixonaut, mais Pixonaut n'a pas pu être joint ou "
"n'a pas accepté l'accès de la boutique : Pixel ne peut donc pas apporter de "
"modifications à votre boutique. Activez l'interrupteur ci-dessous pour "
"réessayer."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:57
msgid "Personalised products now also load on the www. address."
msgstr ""
"Les produits personnalisés se chargent désormais aussi sur l'adresse www."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:58
msgid "Personalised products load on the site's own address only."
msgstr ""
"Les produits personnalisés se chargent uniquement sur l'adresse propre du "
"site."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:59
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not change the addresses personalised products load on. Try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas modifié les adresses sur lesquelles se chargent les "
"produits personnalisés. Réessayez."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:60
msgid ""
"The store's brand is saved. Proofs, corrections and designer links made from "
"now on show it."
msgstr ""
"La marque de la boutique est enregistrée. Les épreuves, corrections et liens "
"de personnalisation créés à partir de maintenant l'affichent."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:61
msgid ""
"That brand is no longer in the Pixonaut workspace, so the store's brand did "
"not change. Choose another."
msgstr ""
"Cette marque ne figure plus dans l'espace de travail Pixonaut, la marque de "
"la boutique n'a donc pas changé. Choisissez-en une autre."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:62
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not confirm the change of the store's brand. Check the brand "
"shown below, and try again if it is not the one you chose."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas confirmé le changement de marque de la boutique. Vérifiez "
"la marque affichée ci-dessous et réessayez si ce n'est pas celle que vous "
"avez choisie."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:63
msgid ""
"The store's print file settings are saved. Print files made from now on "
"follow them, unless a template sets its own."
msgstr ""
"Les réglages des fichiers d'impression de la boutique sont enregistrés. Les "
"fichiers d'impression produits à partir de maintenant les suivent, sauf si "
"un modèle définit les siens."

#. translators: %s: the limits of a live text tolerance, e.g. 1 to 100 px, or 0.01 to 5 mm.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:65
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The live text tolerance is %s, so the print file settings did not change. "
"Enter a tolerance in those limits, or leave it empty to follow the workspace."
msgstr ""
"La tolérance du texte modifiable doit être de %s, les réglages des fichiers "
"d'impression n'ont donc pas changé. Saisissez une tolérance dans ces "
"limites, ou laissez le champ vide pour suivre l'espace de travail."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:66
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not confirm the change of the store's print file settings. "
"Check the settings shown below, and try again if they are not the ones you "
"chose."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas confirmé la modification des réglages des fichiers "
"d'impression de la boutique. Vérifiez les réglages affichés ci-dessous et "
"réessayez s'ils ne correspondent pas à votre choix."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:67
msgid "That connect link expired or was already used. Connect again."
msgstr ""
"Ce lien de connexion a expiré ou a déjà été utilisé. Connectez à nouveau la "
"boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:68
msgid "The connect was cancelled in Pixonaut."
msgstr "La connexion a été annulée dans Pixonaut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:69
msgid "Pixonaut did not approve the connect. Connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas approuvé la connexion. Connectez à nouveau la boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:70
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not hand over the store's keys: the approval expired or "
"Pixonaut could not be reached. Connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas transmis les clés de la boutique : l'approbation a expiré "
"ou Pixonaut n'a pas pu être joint. Connectez à nouveau la boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:71
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace's plan connects no more stores. Upgrade the plan, or "
"disconnect another store on the API Keys page in the Pixonaut studio, then "
"connect again."
msgstr ""
"L'offre de l'espace de travail Pixonaut ne permet pas de connecter d'autres "
"boutiques. Passez à une offre supérieure, ou déconnectez une autre boutique "
"sur la page API Keys du studio Pixonaut, puis connectez à nouveau la "
"boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:72
msgid ""
"Pixonaut handed over the store's keys, but the store could not save them to "
"its database. Check the database, then connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut a transmis les clés de la boutique, mais la boutique n'a pas pu les "
"enregistrer dans sa base de données. Vérifiez la base de données, puis "
"connectez à nouveau la boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:73
msgid "Another connect or disconnect is in progress. Try again in a minute."
msgstr ""
"Une autre connexion ou déconnexion est en cours. Réessayez dans une minute."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:74
msgid ""
"The store could not remove its Pixonaut keys from its database. Check the "
"database, then disconnect again."
msgstr ""
"La boutique n'a pas pu supprimer ses clés Pixonaut de sa base de données. "
"Vérifiez la base de données, puis déconnectez à nouveau la boutique."

#. translators: Name of the production Pixonaut workspace environment, where orders reach a printshop. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:78
msgid "Live"
msgstr "Live"

#. translators: Name of the Pixonaut test environment, where orders never reach a printshop. Shown on the connection card, as a heading or button.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:80
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:100
msgid "Sandbox"
msgstr "Sandbox"

#. translators: The switch on the connection card that lets Pixel, Pixonaut's assistant, act on the store from the Pixonaut studio.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:82
msgid "Allow Pixel to make changes to your store"
msgstr "Autoriser Pixel à apporter des modifications à votre boutique"

#. translators: The switch on the connection card that lets Pixel, Pixonaut's assistant, act on the store from the Pixonaut studio.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:83
msgid ""
"Pixel in the Pixonaut studio can then read and change products, variations, "
"attributes, categories and tags, link templates to products, and read "
"orders. Nothing else in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Pixel, dans le studio Pixonaut, pourra alors lire et modifier les produits, "
"les variations, les attributs, les catégories et les étiquettes, lier des "
"modèles aux produits et lire les commandes. Rien d'autre dans WordPress."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:92
msgid "You can turn this off at any time."
msgstr "Vous pouvez désactiver cette option à tout moment."

#. translators: Text before two buttons on the connection card, Live workspace and Sandbox, read: or connect only to the [Live workspace] [Sandbox].
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:98
msgid "or connect only to the"
msgstr "ou connecter uniquement à :"

#. translators: Button on the connection card: connect only to the live Pixonaut workspace.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:99
msgid "Live workspace"
msgstr "Espace de travail Live"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:103
msgid ""
"Connect a staging or test site to the sandbox: its orders never reach a "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Connectez un site de préproduction ou de test au sandbox : ses commandes ne "
"parviennent jamais à un imprimeur."

#. translators: %s: comma separated addresses the store sends requests to instead of Pixonaut's, e.g. http://localhost:8787. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:118
#, php-format
msgid "The store talks to %s instead of Pixonaut, and sends its key there."
msgstr ""
"La boutique communique avec %s au lieu de Pixonaut, et y envoie sa clé."

#. translators: %s: an HTTP method and path of a Pixonaut API operation, e.g. GET /v1/connect. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:136
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut deprecated %s, which this plugin uses. Update Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut a rendu obsolète %s, que cette extension utilise. Mettez à jour "
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce."

#. translators: 1: an HTTP method and path of a Pixonaut API operation, e.g. GET /v1/connect, 2: the date it stops working. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:138
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut deprecated %1$s, which this plugin uses, and stops answering it on "
"%2$s. Update Pixonaut for WooCommerce before then."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut a rendu obsolète %1$s, que cette extension utilise, et cessera d'y "
"répondre le %2$s. Mettez à jour Pixonaut for WooCommerce d'ici là."

#. translators: 1: wp-admin's origin, e.g. https://admin.example.com, 2: the site's origin, 3: HTML link to Settings > General. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:151
#, php-format
msgid ""
"wp-admin is at <code>%1$s</code> and the site at <code>%2$s</code>. Pixonaut "
"sends you back to wp-admin and delivers events to the REST API only on the "
"site's own address. Make the WordPress Address and the Site Address the same "
"under <a href=\"%3$s\">Settings &gt; General</a>, then connect."
msgstr ""
"wp-admin se trouve à <code>%1$s</code> et le site à <code>%2$s</code>. "
"Pixonaut vous renvoie vers wp-admin et ne livre les évènements à l'API REST "
"que sur l'adresse propre du site. Rendez identiques l'Adresse web de "
"WordPress (URL) et l'Adresse web du site (URL) dans <a "
"href=\"%3$s\">Réglages &gt; Général</a>, puis connectez la boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:163
msgid ""
"Connect the store to a Pixonaut workspace. You approve the connection in "
"Pixonaut and are sent back here."
msgstr ""
"Connectez la boutique à un espace de travail Pixonaut. Vous approuvez la "
"connexion dans Pixonaut, puis êtes renvoyé ici."

#. translators: Button on the connection card that starts connecting the store; here Connect is a verb.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:164
msgid "Connect to Pixonaut"
msgstr "Connecter à Pixonaut"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:169
msgid ""
"Site URL changed: this site is not the one that connected to Pixonaut, so "
"nothing is sent for the site it was copied from. Personalised products and "
"orders are paused until you connect this site. For a staging site, pick "
"Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"L'URL du site a changé : ce site n'est pas celui qui s'est connecté à "
"Pixonaut ; rien n'est donc envoyé pour le site dont il est la copie. Les "
"produits personnalisés et les commandes sont en pause jusqu'à ce que vous "
"connectiez ce site. Pour un site de préproduction, choisissez Sandbox."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:173
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer accepts this store's key: the store was disconnected in "
"Pixonaut, or its key was revoked. Personalised products and orders are "
"paused until you connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'accepte plus la clé de cette boutique : la boutique a été "
"déconnectée dans Pixonaut, ou sa clé a été révoquée. Les produits "
"personnalisés et les commandes sont en pause jusqu'à ce que vous connectiez "
"à nouveau la boutique."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:177
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached just now. This is the connection as it was "
"when the store connected."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut n'a pas pu être joint pour le moment. Voici la connexion telle "
"qu'elle était lorsque la boutique s'est connectée."

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the name of the store's API key in Pixonaut.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:183
msgid "Key name"
msgstr "Nom de la clé"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the Pixonaut workspace the store is connected to.
#. translators: Row heading in developer tools: the Pixonaut workspace the store is connected to.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:187
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:194
msgid "Workspace"
msgstr "Espace de travail"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: live or sandbox.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:191
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Environnement"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:195
msgid "Orders placed in the sandbox never reach a printshop."
msgstr ""
"Les commandes passées dans le sandbox ne parviennent jamais à un imprimeur."

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the store's address.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:200
msgid "Site URL"
msgstr "URL du site"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the www. address of the site, which can be allowed in addition.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:205
msgid "Also allow"
msgstr "Autoriser aussi"

#. translators: Status on the connection card: the www. address is allowed.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:209
msgid "Allowed"
msgstr "Autorisée"

#. translators: Link on the connection card that stops allowing the www. address.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:210
msgid "Take away"
msgstr "Retirer"

#. translators: Button on the connection card that allows the www. address; here Allow is a verb.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:212
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Autoriser"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:214
msgid ""
"Allow it when the store also answers on this address, so personalised "
"products load there too."
msgstr ""
"Autorisez-la si la boutique répond aussi sur cette adresse, afin que les "
"produits personnalisés s'y chargent également."

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the state of Pixonaut's event deliveries to the store.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:220
msgid "Webhooks"
msgstr "Crochets Web"

#. translators: Status on the connection card: Pixonaut's webhook endpoint for the store is off.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:223
msgid "Switched off"
msgstr "Désactivé"

#. translators: Status on the connection card: Pixonaut cannot reach the store's address, so it sends no webhooks.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:225
msgid "Cannot reach the store"
msgstr "Boutique injoignable"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:227
msgid "Pixonaut did not say how deliveries are going."
msgstr "Pixonaut n'a pas indiqué l'état des livraisons."

#. translators: %d: number of webhook deliveries from Pixonaut that failed. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:234
#, php-format
msgid "Failing: %d delivery failed"
msgid_plural "Failing: %d deliveries failed"
msgstr[0] "En échec : %d livraison échouée"
msgstr[1] "En échec : %d livraisons échouées"

#. translators: Status on the connection card: the store's webhook endpoint is on and healthy.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:241
msgid "Receiving events"
msgstr "Réception des évènements"

#. translators: %s: how long ago the test request was sent, e.g. 5 mins. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:249
#, php-format
msgid "Test request delivered %s ago."
msgstr "Requête de test livrée il y a %s."

#. translators: 1: how long ago the test request was sent, e.g. 5 mins, 2: why it was not delivered. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:251
#, php-format
msgid "Test request not delivered %1$s ago: %2$s"
msgstr "Requête de test non livrée il y a %1$s : %2$s"

#. translators: Button on the connection card: ask Pixonaut to send the store a test webhook.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:256
msgid "Send test request"
msgstr "Envoyer une requête de test"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: Pixel, Pixonaut's assistant, and whether it may act on the store.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:262
msgid "Pixel"
msgstr "Pixel"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:271
msgid ""
"On. Pixel in the Pixonaut studio can read and change products, variations, "
"attributes, categories and tags, link templates to products, and read "
"orders. Nothing else in WordPress. Turning it off cuts its access at once."
msgstr ""
"Activé. Pixel, dans le studio Pixonaut, peut lire et modifier les produits, "
"les variations, les attributs, les catégories et les étiquettes, lier des "
"modèles aux produits et lire les commandes. Rien d'autre dans WordPress. Le "
"désactiver coupe son accès immédiatement."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:273
msgid ""
"Off, turned off here. Pixonaut cannot turn it back on: only this switch can."
msgstr ""
"Désactivé, ici même. Pixonaut ne peut pas le réactiver : seul cet "
"interrupteur le peut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:283
msgid "You chat with Pixel in the Pixonaut studio."
msgstr "Vous discutez avec Pixel dans le studio Pixonaut."

#. translators: Link on the connection card to the Pixonaut studio, where the merchant chats with Pixel, Pixonaut's assistant; Pixel is a name, keep it as it is.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:284
msgid "Open the studio"
msgstr "Ouvrir le studio"

#. translators: Heading on the connection card of the settings that live in the Pixonaut workspace.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:292
msgid "Workspace settings"
msgstr "Réglages de l'espace de travail"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:294
msgid ""
"Set in the Pixonaut studio, except the brand and the print files, which you "
"choose here. They shape the pages Pixonaut shows your customers, and the "
"orders it places."
msgstr ""
"Définis dans le studio Pixonaut, sauf la marque et les fichiers "
"d'impression, que vous choisissez ici. Ils déterminent les pages que "
"Pixonaut affiche à vos clients et les commandes qu'il passe."

#. translators: Link to the Pixonaut studio, where the workspace settings are changed.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:295
msgid "Change them in the studio"
msgstr "Les modifier dans le studio"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the workspace brand the store's customer-facing Pixonaut pages are drawn in.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:300
msgid "Brand"
msgstr "Marque"

#. translators: %s: the name of a brand in the Pixonaut workspace. Option on the connection card for the brand every store without one of its own is drawn in.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:311
#, php-format
msgid "%s (workspace default)"
msgstr "%s (par défaut dans l'espace de travail)"

#. translators: Button on the connection card that saves the brand chosen for the store.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:319
msgid "Save brand"
msgstr "Enregistrer la marque"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:322
msgid ""
"The logo and colour of the proof, correction and designer pages Pixonaut "
"shows your customers. A link keeps the brand it was made in."
msgstr ""
"Le logo et la couleur des pages d'épreuve, de correction et de "
"personnalisation que Pixonaut affiche à vos clients. Un lien conserve la "
"marque avec laquelle il a été créé."

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the logo and accent colour of the store's brand.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:327
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "Identité visuelle"

#. translators: Alt text of the workspace's logo image on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:330
msgid "Workspace logo"
msgstr "Logo de l'espace de travail"

#. translators: Shown on the connection card when the workspace has no logo.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:332
msgid "No logo"
msgstr "Aucun logo"

#. translators: Shown on the connection card when the workspace has no accent colour.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:337
msgid "No accent colour"
msgstr "Aucune couleur d'accentuation"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: whether proofs carry a watermark.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:342
msgid "Proof watermark"
msgstr "Filigrane des épreuves"

#. translators: Value on the connection card when Pixonaut did not say.
#. translators: Shown on the connection card when the store has not read the workspace's default language.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:347
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:359
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:447
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Inconnu"

#. translators: Value on the connection card when Pixonaut did not say.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:348
msgid "On: proofs carry a watermark"
msgstr "Activé : les épreuves portent un filigrane"

#. translators: Value on the connection card: the proof watermark is off.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:348
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Désactivé"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the lowest print resolution Pixonaut accepts, in dots per inch.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:354
msgid "Minimum resolution"
msgstr "Résolution minimale"

#. translators: %s: the minimum print resolution in dots per inch, e.g. 150. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:361
#, php-format
msgid "%s dpi, unless a template sets its own"
msgstr "%s dpi, sauf si un modèle définit la sienne"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the form of the print files Pixonaut makes of the store's designs.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:378
msgid "Print files"
msgstr "Fichiers d'impression"

#. translators: %s: the print file form the workspace sets, e.g. Flat. Option on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:387
#, php-format
msgid "Follow the workspace (%s)"
msgstr "Suivre l'espace de travail (%s)"

#. translators: Option on the connection card: print files take the form the Pixonaut workspace sets.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:389
msgid "Follow the workspace"
msgstr "Suivre l'espace de travail"

#. translators: 1: a print file form, e.g. Layers with live text, 2: a live text tolerance, e.g. 1 px. Shown on the connection card.
